This was a particularly active period of targeted fixes.

### 4.1 Schedule visibility and tutor schedule management

[PR #6 — Tutor schedules, sidebar and Google sign-in](https://github.com/jaystarbliss-dynamic-hub/V3-JAYSTARBLISS-STUDIOS-MAIN-WEBSITE/pull/6?utm_source=chatgpt.com) and [PR #7 — Student class schedule visibility](https://github.com/jaystarbliss-dynamic-hub/V3-JAYSTARBLISS-STUDIOS-MAIN-WEBSITE/pull/7?utm_source=chatgpt.com) addressed schedule workflows.

The work improved:

