### 4.2 Restricting curriculum resource management

[PR #8 — Restrict curriculum uploads and make resources read-first](https://github.com/jaystarbliss-dynamic-hub/V3-JAYSTARBLISS-STUDIOS-MAIN-WEBSITE/pull/8?utm_source=chatgpt.com) tightened resource permissions.

