[PR #10](https://github.com/jaystarbliss-dynamic-hub/V3-JAYSTARBLISS-STUDIOS-MAIN-WEBSITE/pull/10?utm_source=chatgpt.com), [PR #14](https://github.com/jaystarbliss-dynamic-hub/V3-JAYSTARBLISS-STUDIOS-MAIN-WEBSITE/pull/14?utm_source=chatgpt.com) and [PR #16](https://github.com/jaystarbliss-dynamic-hub/V3-JAYSTARBLISS-STUDIOS-MAIN-WEBSITE/pull/16?utm_source=chatgpt.com) continued to refine schedule visibility and portal navigation.

These changes included:

