The key distinction is that a student calendar should not be a global timetable with a student filter added on top. It should be a view of the schedule the authenticated student is actually allowed to see.

### 4.4 Tutor subject approvals and profile management

[PR #13 — Tutor subject approvals, profile settings and staff payouts](https://github.com/jaystarbliss-dynamic-hub/V3-JAYSTARBLISS-STUDIOS-MAIN-WEBSITE/pull/13?utm_source=chatgpt.com) covered another set of operational workflows.

